results.releaseNotes:
In this quick fix update (1.4.1):
- fixed bug: UI was not displaying correctly (totally black) on certain iPhone models;
- added ability to donate tips to the developer in the Settings -> Tips menu;
- minor bug fixes.

In previous big update (1.4.0):
- iPhone support added! Now you can compose, play and edit your tunes directly on your pocket iPhone with full functional of the iPad app!
- portrait UI orientation support added (for iPad) to comply with new iPadOS 26 features;
- 4x4 pad layout added. Activated when iPad is in portrait orientation;
- new UI feature: now you can drag the "Collapse" button up/down to set the manual size of the bottom pads/keyboard section;
- new Binaural Pan IFX added, which simulates realistic binaural panning with adjustable Azimuth from -120° Left to +120° Right;
- fixed: export patterns from GR16 -> GR2 now works.
